        73.38239288330078,
        527.4299926757812,
        87.82539367675781
      ],
      "text": "Among all study participants, the difference in incidence rate of TB (including deaths from any cause)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        87.38239288330078,
        527.4210815429688,
        101.82539367675781
      ],
      "text": "between 1HP and 9H (1HP arm minus 9H arm) was −0.02 per 100 person-years (95% CI: −0.35 to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        101.38239288330078,
        527.41015625,
        115.82539367675781
      ],
      "text": "0.30); the relative risk (RR) for treatment completion of 1HP over 9H was 1.04 (95% CI: 0.99–1.10);",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        115.38239288330078,
        527.416748046875,
        129.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "the RR for Grade 3–5 adverse events was 0.86 (95% CI: 0.58–1.27); hazard ratio of death from any",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        129.3824005126953,
        527.4210815429688,
        143.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "cause was 0.75 in favour of 1HP (95% CI: 0.42–1.31); RR for emergence of resistance to isoniazid and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        143.3824005126953,
        524.41162109375,
        157.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "rifampicin were, respectively, 1.63 (95% CI: 0.17–15.99) and 0.81 (95% CI: 0.06–11.77). Overall non-",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        157.3824005126953,
        527.4179077148438,
        171.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "inferiority as defined by the study protocol was thus shown in the modified intention to treat (mITT)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        171.3824005126953,
        527.4201049804688,
        185.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "population. Non-inferiority was also shown for the sub-group with confirmed TB infection (incidence",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        185.3824005126953,
        527.3956909179688,
        199.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "rate difference per 100 person-years was 0.069 (–0.830 to 0.690)), as well as in males and females,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        199.3824005126953,
        524.3546142578125,
        213.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "and among those on or without ART at start of study. The number of patients with CD4 < 250 cells/",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        213.3824005126953,
        489.5447692871094,
        227.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "mm  was small, and neither inferiority nor non-inferiority of 1HP was shown in this stratum.  3",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        241.27239990234375,
        333.5284729003906,
        255.6273956298828
      ],
      "text": "Weekly rifapentine plus isoniazid for 3 months (3HP)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        255.3824005126953,
        527.3882446289062,
        269.8254089355469
      ],
      "text": "A systematic review was conducted for the 2018 guidelines update to compare the effectiveness of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        269.38238525390625,
        527.421142578125,
        283.8254089355469
      ],
      "text": "a 3-month weekly regimen of rifapentine plus isoniazid (3HP) with that of isoniazid monotherapy.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        283.38238525390625,
        527.4127197265625,
        297.8254089355469
      ],
      "text": "The review covered four RCTs  , which were analyzed for three subgroups, including adults  (79-82)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        297.38238525390625,
        139.706298828125,
        311.8254089355469
      ],
      "text": "living with HIV.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        325.3824157714844,
        527.3839111328125,
        339.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "Two of the RCTs involved adults with HIV from South Africa, Peru and a number of countries with a TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        339.3824157714844,
        527.4168090820312,
        353.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "incidence < 100 per 100 000 population. No significant difference was found in the incidence of TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        353.3824157714844,
        527.4366455078125,
        367.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "disease between participants given a 3HP and 6H or 9H (RR 0.73; 95% CI: 0.23–2.30). Furthermore,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        367.3824157714844,
        527.4169311523438,
        381.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "the risk for hepatotoxicity was significantly lower with 3HP in adults living with HIV (RR 0.26; 95%",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        381.3824157714844,
        527.421142578125,
        395.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "CI: 0.12–0.55). The 3HP regimen was also associated with a higher completion rate in all subgroups",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        395.3824157714844,
        527.3814086914062,
        409.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "(adults with HIV: RR 1.25; 95% CI: 1.01–1.55). One RCT included a comparison between 3HP and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        409.3824157714844,
        527.420654296875,
        423.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "continuous isoniazid monotherapy in adult people living with HIV  . No significant difference in  (79)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        423.3824157714844,
        527.4419555664062,
        437.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "TB incidence was found in an intention-to-treat analysis; however, a per-protocol analysis showed a",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        437.3824157714844,
        527.4212036132812,
        451.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "lower rate of TB infection or death in participants given continuous isoniazid. In all the studies, 3HP",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        451.3824157714844,
        237.46664428710938,
        465.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "was given under direct observation.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        479.2064208984375,
        383.54217529296875,
        493.6274108886719
      ],
      "text": "Recommendation 21: 36 months of daily isoniazid monotherapy",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiboldItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        493.3824157714844,
        527.4378051757812,
        507.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "A systematic review and meta-analysis of three RCTs of people living with HIV in settings with high TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        507.3824462890625,
        527.4376831054688,
        521.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "prevalence and transmission showed that continuous IPT can reduce the risk for TB disease by 38%",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        521.3824462890625,
        527.411376953125,
        535.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "more than 6 months’ isoniazid  . The effect was greater in people with a positive TST (49% for  (83)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        535.3824462890625,
        527.4100952148438,
        549.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "TB disease and 50% for death). In those with a negative TST, neither effect was significant, although",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        549.3824462890625,
        527.4430541992188,
        563.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "the point estimate indicated a reduction in TB incidence of 27%. In two of the studies reviewed, ART",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        563.3824462890625,
        527.4420776367188,
        577.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "was not used and in the third ART coverage was low at baseline but increased during the period of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        577.3823852539062,
        127.76139068603516,
        591.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "observation.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        605.3823852539062,
        527.4201049804688,
        619.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "This recommendation is conditional and based on evidence that longer-term IPT significantly adds",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        619.3823852539062,
        527.4199829101562,
        633.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "benefit to ART. The efficacy, safety and convenience of repeated treatment with shorter rifapentine",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        633.3823852539062,
        527.4213256835938,
        647.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "regimens is being studied in people living with HIV in such settings. The definition of a high TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        647.3823852539062,
        527.3926391601562,
        661.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "transmission setting should be established by the national authorities. Testing for TB infection is not",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        661.3823852539062,
        527.39697265625,
        675.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "a prerequisite for TPT in people living with HIV but its use is encouraged because people who are",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        675.3823852539062,
        527.4122924804688,
        689.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "TST positive have a greater protective benefit from TPT. People living with HIV with a negative TST",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        689.3823852539062,
        261.0274658203125,
        703.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "should not receive 36 months of daily IPT.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        717.2723999023438,
        181.61410522460938,
        731.6273803710938
      ],
      "text": "Special considerations",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        731.3823852539062,
        527.4158935546875,
        745.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "Careful consideration should be given to the selection of TPT regimen for people living with HIV.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        745.3823852539062,
        527.4257202148438,
        759.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "Rifamycins induce certain cytochrome P-450 enzymes and may therefore accelerate the elimination",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        759.3823852539062,
        527.4215698242188,
        773.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "of medicines that depend on this metabolic pathway, including several antiretroviral drugs (ARVs)  .  (22)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        329.7992858886719,
        801.2599487304688,
        553.4072875976562,
        811.8897705078125
      ],
      "text": "27 2. ﻿ Reduce the burden of TB among people living with HIV",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}